+- **arXiv:2505.04842 — "Putting the Value Back in RL (RL^V)" (Microsoft):** Track: verifier-distillation-into-Q-head. Jointly trains an LLM as reasoner + generative verifier so a learned value function survives GRPO/PPO; reports +20% MATH with parallel sampling, 8-32x test-time-compute efficiency. Closest peer to Carnot's offline-distillation-oracle bet (self-trained verifier vs Carnot's external energy ensemble). Numbers source-reported only.
+- **arXiv:2512.15605 v4 — "Autoregressive LMs are Secretly Energy-Based Models (ARM↔EBM)" (Blondel et al., May 2026):** Track: EBT/energy theory + verifier-distillation. Explicit ARM↔EBM bijection (soft-Bellman/MaxEnt-RL special case) with theoretical error bounds for distilling an EBM into an ARM. Theoretical underwriting that energy-as-selector and energy-as-generator are two views of one object, and bounds the cost of distilling Carnot's energy into an autoregressive/Q-head student.
+- **arXiv:2510.13744 — "Hard2Verify: Step-Level Verification Benchmark for Frontier Math" (2025):** Track: process-reward-models / harder eval. Step-level verifier benchmark on recent, hard, open-ended math requiring first-error identification on frontier-LLM outputs. The contamination-resistant eval to re-test Carnot's verifier beyond FoVer/PRMBench — directly relevant to the DT-post-bounded P2 "moat = error-independence, fragile to subsumption" concern.
+- **arXiv:2511.02886 — "Test-time Adaptation of Tiny Recursive Models" (Trelis):** Track: recursive-refiner test-time compute. Pretrains a 7M TRM on public ARC then fine-tunes within competition compute (12.5k steps) to ~6.67% semi-private — the cheap warm-start + adapt-with-feedback workflow shape for a Carnot experiment seeded from the ARC Prize checkpoint.
+- **arXiv:2602.12078 — "Tiny Recursive Reasoning with Mamba-2 Attention Hybrid" (ICLR 2026 wksp):** Track: recursive-refiner substrate. Swaps TRM Transformer blocks for Mamba-2 hybrid at param parity (6.83M); +2.0% pass@2, +4.75% pass@100 on ARC — the recursive-refiner substrate is architecture-flexible, useful when choosing the distilled Q-head's backbone.
